{"type":"standard","title":"Victoria Spartz","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Victoria Spartz</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q44059867","titles":{"canonical":"Victoria_Spartz","normalized":"Victoria Spartz","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Victoria Spartz</span></span>"},"pageid":59158225,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Victoria_Spartz_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg/330px-Victoria_Spartz_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/Victoria_Spartz_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1638,"height":2048},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1358436049","tid":"027e399e-6361-11f1-a320-76ccbc6bf56e","timestamp":"2026-06-08T17:39:33Z","description":"Ukrainian-American politician (born 1978)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Spartz","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Spartz?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Spartz?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Victoria_Spartz"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Spartz","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Victoria_Spartz","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Spartz?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Victoria_Spartz"}},"extract":"Victoria Spartz is a Ukrainian-born American politician and businesswoman who is the U.S. representative for Indiana's 5th congressional district. Spartz is a member of the Republican Party, but declined receiving any Republican committee assignments. She previously represented the 20th district in the Indiana Senate.","extract_html":"<p><b>Victoria Spartz</b> is a Ukrainian-born American politician and businesswoman who is the U.S. representative for Indiana's 5th congressional district. Spartz is a member of the Republican Party, but declined receiving any Republican committee assignments. She previously represented the 20th district in the Indiana Senate.</p>"}